horde = &"stone"
lore = "A rune can never be uncarved, and a Stoneborn who breaks a carved oath turns slowly to stone. The Mountain-King's madness broke every oath in Kharum at once. The Oathbroken march with granite growing through their skin, and hurting them only hurries it."
